    {
      "id": "note_ev",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2300,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 520,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1950254147,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 2052266347,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792525432811,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Every event carries headers:\nevent_id · event_type · schema_version · correlation_id\n\nPayloads are Zod-validated at the consumer.\n\nA business write and its outbox row commit in one local\ntransaction; the relay publishes; the consumer dedupes by\nevent_id in its own transaction (at-least-once, auto-commit,\nno Kafka DLQ).\n\nTopics are created before the apps start (12 partitions).\norder.events / payment.events are intentionally not provisioned\n— the saga is gRPC-orchestrated, not Kafka-driven.",
      "originalText": "Every event carries headers:\nevent_id · event_type · schema_version · correlation_id\n\nPayloads are Zod-validated at the consumer.\n\nA business write and its outbox row commit in one local\ntransaction; the relay publishes; the consumer dedupes by\nevent_id in its own transaction (at-least-once, auto-commit,\nno Kafka DLQ).\n\nTopics are created before the apps start (12 partitions).\norder.events / payment.events are intentionally not provisioned\n— the saga is gRPC-orchestrated, not Kafka-driven.",
      "height": 228,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "containerId": null,
      "index": "b04",
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
