      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792525432811,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DATA OWNERSHIP\n\n• 6 Postgres databases, one per service\n• one login role each; postgres superuser\n  only for migrations\n• no cross-service reads, no shared transaction\n• read models derived, not shared:\n  catalog.stock ← stock.events (revision-guarded)\n• Drizzle migrations per service",
      "originalText": "DATA OWNERSHIP\n\n• 6 Postgres databases, one per service\n• one login role each; postgres superuser\n  only for migrations\n• no cross-service reads, no shared transaction\n• read models derived, not shared:\n  catalog.stock ← stock.events (revision-guarded)\n• Drizzle migrations per service",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "containerId": "card1",
      "index": "b07V",
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "card2",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 1660,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 460,
      "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6",
