    {
      "id": "card2-label",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 790,
      "y": 1775,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 230,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 440037423,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1120365899,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792525432811,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "COMMUNICATION & GUARANTEES\n\nSync — gRPC request/response\n• 3s timeout at the gateway\n• reads retried ×3 on UNAVAILABLE /\n  RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED / DEADLINE_EXCEEDED\n• mutations never retried\n• circuit breaker 50% over 20 calls, open 30s\n\nAsync — outbox → Kafka → inbox\n• at-least-once, dedupe by event_id\n• no retry topic / DLQ yet",
      "originalText": "COMMUNICATION & GUARANTEES\n\nSync — gRPC request/response\n• 3s timeout at the gateway\n• reads retried ×3 on UNAVAILABLE /\n  RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED / DEADLINE_EXCEEDED\n• mutations never retried\n• circuit breaker 50% over 20 calls, open 30s\n\nAsync — outbox → Kafka → inbox\n• at-least-once, dedupe by event_id\n• no retry topic / DLQ yet",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "containerId": "card2",
      "index": "b08V",
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "card3",
