      "versionNonce": 1761531531,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792525432811,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DEPLOYMENT & BOUNDARIES\n\n• one image; SERVICE selects the runtime\n• compose (local) + k8s (ingress, probes)\n• gateway :3000 · gRPC :50051\n• health: /health/live · /health/ready\n\nNot built (so the diagram isn't over-read):\n• payment provider is a synchronous mock\n• no order.events / payment.events\n• no Kafka DLQ; product image upload\n  not wired end-to-end",
      "originalText": "DEPLOYMENT & BOUNDARIES\n\n• one image; SERVICE selects the runtime\n• compose (local) + k8s (ingress, probes)\n• gateway :3000 · gRPC :50051\n• health: /health/live · /health/ready\n\nNot built (so the diagram isn't over-read):\n• payment provider is a synchronous mock\n• no order.events / payment.events\n• no Kafka DLQ; product image upload\n  not wired end-to-end",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
